<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday for a public holiday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Taiwan dollar finished at T$27.662 against Tuesday's T$27.667 close.</p>
<p>Turnover through dealers was a modest US$213 million.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
